<title>ZAIRE: GOVERNMENT LIST.</title>
<headline>GOVERNMENT LIST.</headline>
<text>
<p>ZAIRE GOVERNMENT LIST (970411)</p>
<p> *************************************************************</p>
<p> * 11 Apr 97 - Emergency rule prime minister General Likulia *</p>
<p> *		 Bolongo announced a 28-member national	  *</p>
<p> *		 salvation government.				 *</p>
<p> *************************************************************</p>
<p> President..........................(Marshal) MOBUTU Sese Seko</p>
<p>				- - - - - - -</p>
<p>NATIONAL SALVATION GOVERNMENT (Formed 11 April 97)</p>
<p> Prime Minister (Apptd 9 Apr 97).......General LIKULIA Bolongo</p>
<p> Deputy Prime Minister............General MAHELE Lieko Bokungo</p>
<p> (Also Minister of Defence)</p>
<p> Deputy Prime Minister......................KAMANDA Wa Kamanda</p>
<p> (Also Minister of Foreign Affairs)</p>
<p>				- - - - - - -</p>
<p>MINISTERS (known so far)</p>
<p> Defence.............................See Deputy Prime Minister</p>
<p> Foreign Affairs.....................See Deputy Prime Minister</p>
<p> Interior..............................General ILUNGA Shamanga</p>
<p>				- - - - - - -</p>
<p> Central Bank Governor...........Patrice DJAMBOLEKA Okitongono</p>
<p>				- - - - - - -</p>
<p>	 NOTE: Any comments/queries on the content of this</p>
<p>		 government list, please contact the Reuter</p>
<p>		 Editorial Reference Unit, London, on (171) 542</p>
<p>		 7968.</p>
<p>			  (End government list)</p>
</text>
